### Media folders

We have set {% if has_media_path %}`{{ media_path }}` and {% endif %}`/downloads` as optional path{% if has_media_path %}s{% endif %}, this is because it is the easiest way to get started. While easy to use, it has some drawbacks. Mainly losing the ability to hardlink (TL;DR a way for a file to exist in multiple places on the same file system while only consuming one file worth of space), or atomic move (TL;DR instant file moves, rather than copy+delete) files while processing content.

Use the optional path{% if has_media_path %}s{% endif %} if you don't understand, or don't want hardlinks/atomic moves.

